This distribution contains a modified build of NVIDIA NeMo-Speech.cpp.
Upstream source: https://github.com/NVIDIA/NeMo-Speech.cpp
Pinned commit: 4f9676226f667d14608487df744f375db87127f8

Modification: realtime-language-v1.patch adds a runtime capability declaration
to GET /ready and transports final ASR language metadata separately from the
transcript. No other functional source modification is authorized.

The Nemotron speech model is not included. NVIDIA GPU drivers are not included.
Third-party license texts and the machine-readable inventory are included in
each runtime ZIP.

Release lid.3 uses static vcpkg libraries with the dynamic Microsoft Visual C++
Runtime. Required release x64 CRT DLLs are redistributed unmodified and
app-local from the Redist directory of the effective Visual Studio 2022
toolchain. Each ZIP includes the applicable Visual Studio license terms, the
official REDIST list, and a per-DLL version, origin, signature, and SHA-256
inventory. The Visual C++ Runtime informational license is not used as the
redistribution grant.
